{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：19:51 2026-11-18 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"「友得盈」後上險勝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/2e8e8af11c10d05a1ff060a9a44a7a79/2026-11/r22.jpg\"/>\n<p>丁冠豪馬房的「友得盈」之前連拼多場無功，今晚回師其唯一贏馬路程谷草一千米，終於岀擊得手，直路上越過「精益大師」，為馬房贏得今季第二場頭馬，鞍上人周俊樂今季頭馬數字達至二十場。</p>\n<p>練馬師丁冠豪目前在紐西蘭馬匹拍賣會，由副練黎海榮主持大局，「友得盈」馬主之是袁仕傑，他是前香港馬王好爸爸的馬主。</p>\n<p>賽後袁仕傑說:「丁冠豪對我表示，『友得盈』今仗機會 樂觀，因為馬匹的狀態保持平穩，我們特意搵周俊樂減兩磅出賽，馬兒繼續進步，希望加分後仍然有好表現。在我眼中，丁冠豪是一位很勤力的練馬師，後生仔需要累積更多經驗，我相信他應該是一位很好的練馬師。」</p>\n<h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e7d3854809f36b4638b0bc1ae06a156a/2026-11/2b267719-a510-4780-9fa7-17de6ac0491d.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5d539c8213ec2d99385dc41b6e5f6dbf/2026-11/4ea8d1b4-0601-4082-bd6f-b53146ab0ded.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/992ea2c179ab1a560e325036e7737470/2026-11/16f52541-c541-4e87-bb1d-6c313d407bd1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d1e7e32615dc7ee442e922ffde56af37/2026-11/53be97ce-2e43-4c93-b3d7-00d12a188a05.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/71fec37829b10ff5e5d30f05e7cad00f/2026-11/101b0f58-2a0d-4a8b-82b7-6f685e093f04.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c27e56196ebca09f6e6cf56ef5df7326/2026-11/882dcb2d-b8ed-40a0-9bd0-5f4f11789699.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8183e202e7e73eb974049a0a3a742ce7/2026-11/5530ea49-8f63-4b9b-8709-b0d701e3280e.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6833d6b03d47bfcecb1f0256cb74f28c/2026-11/1548673e-75d8-41fc-943a-e709587cd3c9.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6be2bd6db36a1738b92ce39312f3c034/2026-11/7578413d-9fb7-4c2c-94fa-cf01625d640e.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8e3ce22d520cd2e61c5638807e1f6daf/2026-11/47053387-0440-4c4f-b0cf-717d4e15077d.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/15c5e374f3dbfa9e5588eb1d3adfa952/2026-11/b805eafc-7253-483f-9e1c-0eba3d96e3dc.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ee1ca2004767a917bdc7e46b2498e46b/2026-11/b66429ca-7b26-46ff-9541-6173e32576b4.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/58d53967090cfe6ab1dea152fa0d4186/2026-11/bfc3a62c-9b71-4851-b28e-73482373c175.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7c6d7987ce4ca5bcd399f6d4923a9083/2026-11/r2_4.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T12:04:16.075078+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":303,"images":15,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T11:51:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T12:17:25.812952+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T11:57:21.253149+00:00","content_hash":"00bb590e89cb29e05634b51b7fa56576ec7293827526383f735bf8f503f294f8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}